# Greggs Staff Blacklist

Exact replica of the Mutiny staff blacklist for **Greggs Discord**.

## Features
- Discord login required
- Only "Greggs management" role can add/remove entries
- Removed entries move to Expired tab
- Clean dark UI matching your screenshot

## Deploy to Railway

1. Create Discord Application: https://discord.com/developers/applications
2. Add OAuth2 Redirect URI: `https://YOUR-APP.up.railway.app/auth/discord/callback`
3. Get **Client ID**, **Client Secret**, create Bot + get **Bot Token**
4. Get your **Guild ID** and **Management Role ID**

5. Deploy this repo on Railway
6. Add these Environment Variables in Railway:
   - `DISCORD_CLIENT_ID`
   - `DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET`
   - `DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN`
   - `GUILD_ID`
   - `MANAGEMENT_ROLE_ID`
   - `REDIRECT_URI` (your full callback URL)
   - `SESSION_SECRET` (any long random string)

Done! Share the Railway URL with your staff.
